  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1dc66e9658df9284f81f0664a7ee2889, type: 3}
  m_Name: DarryPassingOnCollectible
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CollectableEntries
  entryTitle: A Note from Darry (Passing On)
  description: 
  neutralDescription: "I can\u2019t even begin to fully comprehend what\u2019s been
    happening, so expecting someone else to explain it to me and know what to say
    is farfetched, to say the least. Still, Echo tried their best, and their effort
    resulted in me breaking free from this traumatic loop. I can only hope they\u2019ll
    find their way too."
  negativeDescription: "While I appreciate that Echo basically broke me out of the
    Astral Plane\u2026was right there and then really the time to ask for a reward?
    I didn\u2019t know I was being watched over, it\u2019s not like I asked them
    to do that! Whatever. Thanks, I guess."
  positiveDescription: "\u2026I\u2019m still trying to wrap my head around it all.
    I remember the house fire, the feeling of\u2026I remember wishing that Reed and
    I parted on better terms. Echo made that possible for me. Being broken out of
    the loop was scary, but the thought of being in it forever, unaware the whole
    time, is much worse. I\u2019m lucky Echo was there watching over me."
